+            // Hexagon: HMX passes a matmul's result through fp16, and w2's raw output reaches 1.2e6
+            // even at 1/128 (Z-Image's massive activations; measured on the CPU, layers.0 at step 2) ->
+            // inf -> a NaN latent. A smaller pre-scale keeps it in range. SD_ZIMAGE_W2_SCALE overrides
